{{!
    @template local_shopping_cart/checkout_link

    Route to the checkout, shown right after the add-to-cart control once the item is in the cart.

    Why it exists: the cart icon is rendered into the navbar by
    local_shopping_cart_render_navbar_output(), so in document order it sits *before* the page
    content. Tabbing on from an add-to-cart button therefore moves away from the cart, and a
    keyboard user has no forward route to the checkout.

    Deliberately not solved by moving focus or by tabindex: focus would jump backwards into the
    navbar after every single add, which breaks adding several items in a row, and a positive
    tabindex would reorder the whole page (WCAG 2.4.3). A real element in document order gives the
    same result - the next TAB lands on it - without touching the tab order. While hidden it is not
    focusable, so it does not lengthen the tab path for anyone who wants to keep browsing.

    cart.js (setButtonLabel) toggles the hidden attribute together with the button state, which is
    why the id has to follow the same componentname-area-itemid pattern as the button.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none - cart.js finds this element by its id

    Context variables required for this template:
    * componentname - component the item belongs to
    * area - area the item belongs to
    * itemid - id of the item
    * itemname - name of the item, used for the accessible name

    Example context (json):
    {
        "componentname": "mod_booking",
        "area": "option",
        "itemid": 1,
        "itemname": "Test item 1"
    }
}}
<a href="{{config.wwwroot}}/local/shopping_cart/checkout.php"
    id="checkoutlink-{{componentname}}-{{area}}-{{itemid}}"
    class="btn btn-sm shopping-cart-checkout-link"
    role="button"
    {{#itemname}}aria-label="{{#str}} tocheckoutitem, local_shopping_cart, {{itemname}} {{/str}}"{{/itemname}}
    {{^itemname}}aria-label="{{#str}} tocheckout, local_shopping_cart {{/str}}"{{/itemname}}
    hidden>
    {{#str}} tocheckout, local_shopping_cart {{/str}}
    <i class="fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</a>
